= The Exodus

Another Labour MP has crossed the floor to the Social Democrats. That makes [+ sdp_lab_mps +] since the Gang of Four broke away. Some have been threatened with deselection by their local parties; others say they no longer recognise the party they joined. Labour's whips have stopped counting.
